ng error handling.","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":14,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"cd1fa7c3691f7347648695f1d600c3ca9800d25c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove unused console presentation code","messageBody":"The GUI and PandaService now own task responses, leaving several legacy Ui methods without callers. Removing them and Todo\u0027s redundant toString override reduces maintenance surface without changing output behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":0,"deletions":56}}},{"hash":"4e5d33d4f67933aed802f5c76b90a7ba8afa6929","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clarify GUI component state","messageBody":"Name the command-processing dependency by its role and replace the avatar-size literal with a named constant. This makes the UI\u0027s responsibilities and layout decision easier to understand without changing behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"d6f0d26fbd83a3f6874e6610eb55b7bce7dd2397","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Encapsulate immutable task state","messageBody":"Descriptions, task types, and event or deadline times are initialized once and accessed through methods. Restricting their visibility and marking them final prevents accidental mutation while retaining the intentional mutable completion status.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"020fdfe4caa60c34d8e80a1ba97cf962b6081a8f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve code quality and encapsulation Remove unused legacy console presentation methods and the redundant Todo.toString() override to reduce maintenance overhead. Clarify GUI code by naming the command-processing dependency by its role and replacing the avatar-size literal with a named constant. Encapsulate task descriptions, types, and date/time fields as private immutable state, while retaining the intentional mutable completion status. These changes improve readability, reduce dead code, avoid unexplained values, and prevent unintended state mutations without changing user-facing behavior.","messageBody":"","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"c56b849ade416698ce0fd2cdfbe734b59eb6208c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from lawjiakai11/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add assertions for task operation invariants","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d289e7b710fe9b06a2778523a7ec60d2594b2f56","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c2ecb8fb88f522a75bb20ac2599400302026b162","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refine code structure for maintainability Remove obsolete console UI helpers and redundant overrides that no longer contribute to the application. Improve GUI readability with descriptive dependency names and a named avatar dimension. Limit task data visibility and make values immutable when they should not change after construction. This keeps implementation details local, makes intent clearer to future readers, and reduces the risk of accidental state changes while preserving existing behavior.","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"e55f6451badf0fa18e9fb0f138f5a2ac5f073c9d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from lawjiakai11/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Branch a code quality","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"2da0e7be93791000b4370e930c68745e3366369a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-CI\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b80ca16c14c09b4a2b7907450082f3758261316c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add temporary deadline date sorting","messageBody":"Add JavaFX controls for enabling a temporary deadline-date view and choosing ascending or descending order. The display puts deadlines first by their due date while preserving the insertion order of todos and events, and it restores the untouched default order when disabled.\n\nKeep storage unchanged so sorting is never persisted. Route list, find, and numbered task operations through the active display order, and add model/service coverage plus user and manual GUI-test documentation for the new behavior.\n","tags":["BCD-Extension","A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"fxml":{"insertions":6,"deletions":1},"java":{"insertions":339,"deletions":13},"md":{"insertions":23,"deletions":23}}},{"hash":"22028746a7a1ea5b14c211470790f13a295fd76d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams for task filtering and sorting Refactor task searching and display-only deadline sorting to use Java Streams. Preserve the existing case-insensitive search behavior, deadline ordering rules, stable task order, and unchanged underlying task list. This makes the collection transformations more declarative while retaining all existing functionality.","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":20}}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"lawjiakai11":{"java":1772,"md":978,"fxml":31,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":21,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVariance":{"lawjiakai11":126576.81},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"lawjiakai11":"CS2103T-T09-1 LAW .. KAI"}}
